{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100652","id":2246682919,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6F6akn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100652","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100652.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100652.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100652","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100652/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100652/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100652/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ccfbdf2bb2f109ba83533a45ef48dd0b219fc872","number":100652,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"`AudioStreamPlaybackWAV`: Inherit from `Resampled`","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**TL;DR: this is a non-breaking change that simplifies AudioStreamWAV a lot while improving the resampling quality.**\r\n\r\nA continuation and updated version of #83483, so everything that has been discussed there applies here. The original author, @wareya, has been added as the commit author, and I left myself as a co-author, as what I've done was mostly patching.\r\n\r\nRemoves the resampling code entirely from `AudioStreamPlaybackWAV` and makes it inherit from `AudioStreamPlaybackResampled`, fixes #58216. This brings the class in par with the Ogg Vorbis and MP3 equivalents, which already inherit from `Resampled`.\r\n\r\nI have tested this with as many audio files I could, with every loop mode, and found no problems.\r\n\r\nAny existing project needs no modifications to work with this PR. It barely modifies unexposed methods, so *no compatibility breaks*.\r\n\r\nA few notable changes:\r\n- IMA ADPCM audio now gets interpolated.\r\n- `do_resample` did two things: convert samples from their format to `AudioFrame`, then apply linear interpolation. Interpolation code was removed and the function renamed to `decode_samples`.\r\n- `DATA_PAD` has been removed from `AudioStreamWAV` as it lost its purpose. Functions that required handling the pads have been simplified, potentially reducing memory overhead.\r\n- QOA caches were also removed, as they were a workaround workaround to make resampling work fine in the previous implementation. Unnecessary in this one.\r\n- Linux release template builds using `production=yes` had a 4KB reduction in binary size. Note however that `AudioStreamPlaybackResampled` have an internal buffer of 1056B.\r\n\r\n## Caveats\r\n\r\nFiles imported with loop mode set to Forward, Ping-Pong or Backward in a build before #96768 was merged will cause crashes, as it will try to read one index out of bounds. It can be fixed by simply reimporting.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055"